  "all iteration counts: cells 240/1150 -> 338-1346, stacker 170/650 -> 282/375/481",
  "stage-2 iteration rule: exp_024 carried exp_016/exp_020's constants; exp_030 derives them from its own stage-1 argmin x a training-row ratio",
